    BodyText: ...
  - SpeakerName: 
    dialogueDisplayTime: 3
    BodyText: "I remember how lively this place was not so long ago\u2026"
  - SpeakerName: 
    dialogueDisplayTime: 3
    BodyText: People were at least still coming down to this section of the ship.
  - SpeakerName: 
    dialogueDisplayTime: 2
    BodyText: "Nowadays I have barely seen a soul\u2026"
